All ported source files carry a prominent modification notice. Independently
written diffusers-3d package glue remains under the package Apache-2.0 license.

Upstream's transformer files are modified copies of Hugging Face Diffusers
(Apache-2.0). This family uses Diffusers' own Transformer2DModel instead.
The converter reproduces the ViT position-embedding interpolation of Hugging
Face Transformers 4.35 (Apache-2.0).

Not included:

- torchmcubes (compiled marching cubes). The package's plain-PyTorch marching
  cubes is an independent implementation of the same rules. It uses Paul
  Bourke's public lookup table, which torchmcubes and PyMCubes (BSD-3-Clause)
  also ship;
- video export and texture baking;
- the rembg background remover, which the package offers as an opt-in.

Weights are not redistributed. The stabilityai/TripoSR model card declares the
MIT license. It lists gating fields, but the Hub reported the repository as not
gated at revision 5b521936b01fbe1890f6f9baed0254ab6351c04a. Its image encoder
derives from facebook/dino-vitb16 (Apache-2.0). Converted checkpoints keep their
own licenses.

